{"id":"58507ea1921a657e","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-free-variable","aliases":["17-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-term]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]"],"source_section":"1.3","source_result":"free/bound-variable convention after 1.3.3","source_pages_print":[23,24],"source_pages_djvu":[39,40],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-1.1.5","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"free/bound-variable convention after 1.3.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>23</span><span>24</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.1.5"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>；项、公式和单字提升分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,w\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(t,u,w\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>。每个递归子句中的符号和元数为该子句的局部参数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\)</span>；应用子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\\)</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\">\\(t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\\)</span>。函数应用子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\)</span>，关系应用子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\)</span>；不要求这些符号类同时非空。等式的两个输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,w\">\\(u,w\\)</span> 不受 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 约束。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L)\">\\(\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}:\\mathrm{Form}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}:\\mathrm{Form}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L)\\)</span> 按下式结构递归定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{x\\},&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\n\\emptyset,&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\ c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t_i),\n&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(u=w)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(u)\\cup\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(w),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\neg\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{x\\},&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\n\\emptyset,&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\ c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t_i),\n&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(u=w)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(u)\\cup\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(w),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\neg\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The simultaneous recursion is the book-17 notation for the mechanism in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"